  skos:definition "प्रभव\t/prabhava/\t\t/прабхава/\tprabhava m. происхожденіе, причина, начало; °prabhava bah. происходящій.\tс. 244"@ru ;
  pwglex:evidenceGrade gr:dict-attested ;
  dct:source "kna" .

<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/praBava-2/dict/fri/3> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
